{
    "word": "passively",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "f7c8fcb4-ce0a-3a02-b343-1c6979da0e77",
                "word": "passively",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "baa6e30c-3677-3436-9552-6d270f4ebb89",
                        "entry_id": "f7c8fcb4-ce0a-3a02-b343-1c6979da0e77",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a passive manner; without conscious or self-directed action."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "284da06e-e18f-40a5-9c7e-698362b43632",
                                "sense_id": "baa6e30c-3677-3436-9552-6d270f4ebb89",
                                "text": "Water flowed passively between tanks via the siphon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7c236bd-a3de-4152-946e-69adcd0a299b",
                                "sense_id": "baa6e30c-3677-3436-9552-6d270f4ebb89",
                                "text": "Due to this pressure aortic and pulmonary valves are opened passively and due to relaxation blood is sucked from the venae cavae into the atrium."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8b1391f-6da6-469b-b0b9-57d23ee8c541",
                                "sense_id": "baa6e30c-3677-3436-9552-6d270f4ebb89",
                                "text": "For most people, this sacrifice is made easily and instinctively. Not so for otroverts, who are neither willing nor able to passively adopt the social scripts that others do. To the otrovert, who is constantly engaged with the choices and consequences of their individual life, social norms follow a circular logic: […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "effcbf8c-708f-37a5-abc9-fb911e3defff",
                        "entry_id": "f7c8fcb4-ce0a-3a02-b343-1c6979da0e77",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an acquiescent manner; resignedly or submissively."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e8035aa9-1902-407c-9d5b-c836a4542b98",
                                "sense_id": "effcbf8c-708f-37a5-abc9-fb911e3defff",
                                "text": "Paradoxically, the same faculty who complain about busyness are most likely to end up waiting passively. While they acquiescently wait to write, they busy themselves with other, often trivial, activities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8a6dd782-ceac-4b04-90a4-78d5ca6bb01c",
                                "sense_id": "effcbf8c-708f-37a5-abc9-fb911e3defff",
                                "text": "They were not waving at him but sat passively as if waiting to hear if what he had to say would be derogatory to their previous relationship."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1670d3bb-0e8d-33ff-93b4-23f82292443d",
                        "entry_id": "f7c8fcb4-ce0a-3a02-b343-1c6979da0e77",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In the passive voice; having a passive construction."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0081c5d1-9723-44a6-8236-fd0baf719a77",
                                "sense_id": "1670d3bb-0e8d-33ff-93b4-23f82292443d",
                                "text": "Statements phrased in an active voice, with a few outcome-oriented goals, improve school performance more than those stated passively with either multiple goals or goals focused on processes or behaviors."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bb4456d5-ba75-41bc-9e90-ad72eae7dcaf",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7c8fcb4-ce0a-3a02-b343-1c6979da0e77",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a passive manner; without conscious or self-directed action",
                        "target_lang_word": "passivement",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "passivement",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "126c7166-0953-3c11-b23b-c0cab6e358c3",
                                        "entry_id": "984bf74a-20f8-3d1f-a667-b614042874a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "D’une manière passive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29e6bfd4-0b87-4812-b856-fcaf357337cd",
                                                "sense_id": "126c7166-0953-3c11-b23b-c0cab6e358c3",
                                                "text": "Maxime attendait passivement une occasion qui le débarrassât de cette maîtresse gênante."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed2d51da-aa3a-480e-a0ca-05fd2e244927",
                                                "sense_id": "126c7166-0953-3c11-b23b-c0cab6e358c3",
                                                "text": "… : mais l’inhumaine Raison enseigne que les rois sont rois, que les grands sont riches, parce que la masse humaine est bête et lâche et se laisse passivement commander et exploiter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f1259b3-902f-3ec0-8fa5-68ff2a36877e",
                                        "entry_id": "984bf74a-20f8-3d1f-a667-b614042874a7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Conformément à la voix passive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "808aef2a-def7-4f5a-b961-fcfc782e12e1",
                                                "sense_id": "8f1259b3-902f-3ec0-8fa5-68ff2a36877e",
                                                "text": "Il y a plusieurs verbes qui se prennent activement et passivement."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b8fd4e8f-730f-4de7-9bba-37e7fb2a1000",
                        "source_entry_id": "f7c8fcb4-ce0a-3a02-b343-1c6979da0e77",
                        "source_sense_description": "in a passive manner; without conscious or self-directed action",
                        "target_lang_word": "passiv",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "passiv",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1b02b0b5-4e20-3d26-b417-94a005da44e5",
                                        "entry_id": "b65145ef-1c0b-3d95-be87-8352da4b8071",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "im Zustand, nichts zu tun"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fc265e3-7452-4893-af47-32b6e1b6ce26",
                                                "sense_id": "1b02b0b5-4e20-3d26-b417-94a005da44e5",
                                                "text": "Nach einem Verkehrsunfall ist es gut, nicht passiv auf dem Beifahrersitz zu verharren, sondern sich bald wieder selber ans Steuer zu setzen, damit erst gar keine Angst vor dem Fahren aufkommt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2f68540-d2cf-4c90-9985-04ff76e3489b",
                                                "sense_id": "1b02b0b5-4e20-3d26-b417-94a005da44e5",
                                                "text": "Vor allem über soziale Netzwerke wie Facebook & Co. konsumieren die User nicht mehr nur passiv Informationen, sondern generieren aktiv Inhalte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4c477f5-1e41-4882-985d-ad6b31a3443f",
                                                "sense_id": "1b02b0b5-4e20-3d26-b417-94a005da44e5",
                                                "text": "Der unorthodox boxende Fury ließ sich den Stil seines Gegners nicht aufzwingen und punktete dank seiner Aktivität auf den Punktzetteln der Wertungsrichter. Klitschko blieb zu passiv. Erst in der Schlussrunde landete er einige klare Treffer, mit denen er Fury einigermaßen beeindrucken konnte. Die aber kamen zu spät."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14d86d37-ab59-4005-9a93-0fb26c1f80a5",
                                                "sense_id": "1b02b0b5-4e20-3d26-b417-94a005da44e5",
                                                "text": "„Denn der bleibt weitgehend passiv und überlässt Vor-, Zu- und Nachbereitung denen, die es wirklich können.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c834502d-c8ee-4a45-8513-67af664db011",
                                                "sense_id": "1b02b0b5-4e20-3d26-b417-94a005da44e5",
                                                "text": "„Diese große Anfangsgeschwindigkeit ermöglicht dem Flugfisch ein Gleiten mit den großen Tragflächen der gespreizten Seitenflossen in Form eines passiven Drachenfluges.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "349780ac-64d7-3d8e-9791-3ca43ce9bcb8",
                                        "entry_id": "b65145ef-1c0b-3d95-be87-8352da4b8071",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "erduldend, was einem passiert, ohne etwas dagegen zu tun"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3d6a6e2-a644-4389-b89d-f554366a0bce",
                                                "sense_id": "349780ac-64d7-3d8e-9791-3ca43ce9bcb8",
                                                "text": "„Zumindest passiv rauchende Kinder bekommen jedoch generell häufiger schwere Infektionen, die im Krankenhaus behandelt werden müssen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "19620553-bab2-3471-a635-e50811832c7b",
                                        "entry_id": "b65145ef-1c0b-3d95-be87-8352da4b8071",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "im Passiv befindlich (= Konjugationsformen des Verbs)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a22b1e8-c426-4e92-a359-921e16c53509",
                                                "sense_id": "19620553-bab2-3471-a635-e50811832c7b",
                                                "text": "„Ein Deponens ist ein Verb mit passiven Formen aber aktiver oder reflexiver Bedeutung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "98176db3-7855-35ee-b432-ff554022949e",
                                        "entry_id": "b65145ef-1c0b-3d95-be87-8352da4b8071",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(auf der passiven Seite der Bestandskonten) ruhend, nicht aktiv (zum Beispiel Darlehen oder Eigenkapital)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Buchhaltung"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
